# cosmo build adaptation: makes the pristine Lua 5.4 sources buildable inside
# this hermetic monorepo. quoted includes of sibling headers already carry
# full repo paths (done mechanically by update.sh); this patch swaps the
# remaining system C-library includes (<string.h>, <stdio.h>, <errno.h>, ...)
# for their cosmopolitan libc/* equivalents (or drops them where a sibling
# header already pulls in what's needed), adds __static_yoink("lua_notice")
# so the linker keeps lua_ident/lua_notice in binaries that never reference
# it directly, and re-flows blank lines and continuation-backslash alignment
# left ragged by those edits. no functional change.
# regenerate by diffing against the pristine mechanically-rewritten sources
# (run update.sh with patches/ moved aside).
